// Your code is using MongoDB Native Driver to connect your Node.js application with MongoDB. There are mainly two common ways to connect MongoDB in Node.js:

// MongoDB Native Driver (your approach)
// Mongoose (most commonly used in Express applications)

// Let's compare both.

// 1. Your Approach: MongoDB Native Driver

// Your code:

